{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"corn_bundle","model_identifier":"corn_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## corn_bundle\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -5.5..6.0, y -3.4..1.6, z -5.9..-0.2 (size 11.5 x 5.0 x 5.7 u = 32 x 14 x 16 cm).\nCorn bundle: four corn cobs carried in the arms, lying across the arms: golden kernels with pale green husks peeled back at one end (alternating ends). Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.4.\n"},"description":"## corn_bundle\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -5.5..6.0, y -3.4..1.6, z -5.9..-0.2 (size 11.5 x 5.0 x 5.7 u = 32 x 14 x 16 cm).\nCorn bundle: four corn cobs carried in the arms, lying across the arms: golden kernels with pale green husks peeled back at one end (alternating ends). Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.4.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"kern_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,-3.1,-3.1],"to":[2.0,-0.8999999999999999,-0.8999999999999999],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,7.0,2.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,9,30.2,11.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[7,0,14.0,2.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,12,2.2,14.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[14,0,21.0,2.2],"texture":0},"down